Pinned source URL (SPEC section 7):

- https://github.com/Slicer/SlicerTestingData/releases/download/SHA256/4507b664690840abb6cb9af2d919377ffc4ef75b167cb6fd0f747befdb12e38e
  (source file `CT-chest.nrrd`, source SHA256 `4507b664690840abb6cb9af2d919377ffc4ef75b167cb6fd0f747befdb12e38e`)

`sample_ct.nrrd` is the source volume downsampled to 128x128x70 (all axes
<= 128, SPEC section 5 memory budget) and re-written as a raw NRRD by
`tools/convert_nrrd.py` at setup time; the committed file's own SHA256 is
recorded in `data/README.md` and SPEC section 7.
